pletions\",\"response_id\":\"chatcmpl-ff0bbf365237443d8b2d632fdd00c259\"}]},\"system_instructions\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":\"Use the declared hello MCP whenever the task asks you to echo a message.\\n## Managed workspace\\n\\n<workspace>\\n  <inputs path=\\\"/workspace/files\\\" access=\\\"read_write\\\" persistence=\\\"task\\\" />\\n  <outputs path=\\\"/workspace/outputs\\\" persistence=\\\"task\\\" />\\n  Save downloaded source material under files/ and deliverables under outputs/. Mounted uploads and recipe files remain read-only; use a new path for modified copies.\\n</workspace>\\nUploaded inputs are read-only. Put intentional task deliverables in the outputs path so the platform can persist them.\\n\\n\\n## Session\\n\\n<session visibility=\\\"project\\\">\\n  <permissions plane=\\\"data\\\">annotations:read conversations:read events:read files:read files:write metrics:read shares:read shares:write tasks:read tasks:write repositories:write telemetry:write git:read</permissions>\\n</session>\\n\\n<cwd>\\n/workspace\\n</cwd>\"}]},\"introspection\":{\"agent\":{\"depth\":\"0\",\"kind\":\"session\"},\"byok\":false,\"contains\":{\"values\":[\"gen_ai.input.messages.role:user\",\"gen_ai.output.messages.parts.type:text\"],\"version\":1},\"environment\":\"production\",\"member\":{\"id\":\"01a16a3c-ca45-748e-bc0c-2079a5b939d3\"},\"org\":{\"id\":\"01a16a3c-ca2f-735b-8698-e5864c11e7ad\"},\"project\":{\"id\":\"01a16a3c-ca52-7546-9fa3-e65ea4ba3bf8\"},\"recipe\":{\"git_commit_sha\":\"543b8db50a839029b03d7ca7957884d806df646c\"},\"run\":{\"id\":\"01a16a3d-3b42-737e-8822-1d8e6ee3ea43\",\"root_id\":\"01a16a3d-2234-72b6-ace3-38db9eb21e9e\"},\"runtime\":{\"group_id\":\"01a16a3c-e0c7-734b-a993-4084d46a8319\",\"id\":\"01a16a3c-f4b9-73de-ade8-0cd1568ca3be\"},\"task\":{\"id\":\"01a16a3d-2234-72b6-ace3-38dcb3c906db\",\"run_id\":\"01a16a3d-3b42-737e-8822-1d8e6ee3ea43\"},\"turn\":3,\"history\":{\"position\":6,\"is_new\":false,\"continuation_method\":\"conversation_id\",\"hash_hit